{
 "schemaVersion": 1,
 "id": "kukhnya-s01e18-scene-20",
 "pair": "ru-en",
 "title": "Прощание  (Farewell)",
 "level": "A1 — Duolingo Section 2",
 "labels": {
  "fedya": "Федя",
  "nagiyev": "Нагиев",
  "senya": "Сеня"
 },
 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Nagiyev has called in the kitchen staff to tell them they are being let go. Senya and Fedya talk it over, and then the payout arrives, and it is not what they hoped. Listen for the amount in the envelope.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Ребята, нам придётся расстаться с вами.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Куда вы собрались так рано?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Нас уволили.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Как уволили? И меня тоже?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Да, мы все уходим.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "А что сказал шеф?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Шеф ничего не сделал.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Теперь мы без работы.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Что нам теперь делать?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Не знаю, пойдём домой.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Вот ваш расчёт.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Только двадцать тысяч?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Остальное будет в конце месяца.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Now the bad news, piece by piece.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Ребята, нам придётся расстаться с вами.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Guys, we'll have to part with you.' \"Nam pridyotsya\", 'to us it will come': we'll have to. \"Rasstatsya s vami\", to part with you.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Куда вы собрались так рано?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Where are you all off to so early?' \"Kuda\" is where to; where at would be \"gde\". \"Sobralis\", set off, is literally 'gathered yourselves'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Нас уволили.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We got fired.' \"Uvolili\", they fired, names nobody: someone fired \"nas\", us.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Как уволили? И меня тоже?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What do you mean, fired? Me too?' \"Kak uvolili?\", 'how fired?', is how Russians question bad news.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Да, мы все уходим.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Yes, we're all leaving.' \"Vse\", everyone, is different from \"vsyo\", everything. \"Ukhodim\", we're leaving: \"u-\" again means away.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "А что сказал шеф?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And what did the chef say?' \"A\" opens a new question: and what about. \"Shef\" came from French.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Шеф ничего не сделал.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The chef did nothing.' \"Nichego ne sdelal\", 'nothing not did': the double 'not' is normal Russian.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Теперь мы без работы.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Now we're out of work.' \"Bez\", without, turns \"rabota\" into \"raboty\".",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Что нам теперь делать?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What do we do now?' \"Chto nam delat?\", 'what to us to do?': the \"nam\" carries the 'we'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Не знаю, пойдём домой.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I don't know, let's go home.' \"Poydyom\", let's go. \"Domoy\" is homeward; at home is \"doma\".",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Вот ваш расчёт.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Here's your pay-off.' \"Raschyot\", the final pay, comes from \"schitat\", to count: everything is settled up.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Только двадцать тысяч?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Only twenty thousand?' \"Dvadtsat\" is \"dva\", two, plus a worn-down 'ten': two tens.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Остальное будет в конце месяца.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The rest will come at the end of the month.' \"Ostalnoe\", the rest, from \"ostatsya\", to remain. \"V kontse mesyatsa\", at the end of the month. And the whole farewell once more.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Ребята, нам придётся расстаться с вами.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Куда вы собрались так рано?",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Нас уволили.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Как уволили? И меня тоже?",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Да, мы все уходим.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "А что сказал шеф?",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Шеф ничего не сделал.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Теперь мы без работы.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Что нам теперь делать?",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Не знаю, пойдём домой.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Вот ваш расчёт.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Только двадцать тысяч?",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Остальное будет в конце месяца.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "The payout is smaller than anyone expected, and the rest is promised for later. Keep \"raschyot\", final pay, from \"schitat\", to count. See you next time!",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Удачи!",
   "gap": 0.3
  }
 ],
